WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.831
The eight-step review reads one ETF the same way every time.

2
00:00:04.831 --> 00:00:10.324
Objective and cost: what the fund tracks and what it charges each year.

3
00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.816
Size and liquidity: how large the fund is and how much it trades.

4
00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:19.985
Holdings and allocation: concentration by company, sector and country.

5
00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:24.155
Performance and risk: returns, volatility and the deepest fall.

6
00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:30.309
Each step shows its data status. It describes the fund; it does not recommend it.
